<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Intel EPS view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Intel EPS view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Thomas Kurlak raised his earnings estimates for the 1996 and 1997 years.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said it expected Intel to produce earnings in the range of $4.65 to $4.75 per share in 1996, up from $4.50 previously, and earnings of $6.20 per share, up from $5.80 per share previously.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
